{"about_the_game":"With &quot;WER WEISS DENN SOWAS?&quot; \u2013 the official game based on one of Germany\u2019s most successful TV show formats \u2013 you can now put your knowledge to the test. Play alongside Elton, Bernhard Ho\u00ebcker, or up to three friends in exciting contests. 30 complete shows with over 390 questions from more than 100 categories and the corresponding answers await you. The gripping matches will demand everything you\u2019ve got. You\u2019ll often be left wondering \u201cWho even knows these things?\u201d \u2013 or do you know what the 20-20-20 rule helps with? No?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Perfect implementation of the TV show with the characters and original voices of Kai Pflaume, Bernhard Ho\u00ebcker, and Elton.<br></li><li>30 complete shows with over 390 questions from more than 100 categories, and answer videos just like in the show itself.<br></li><li>One, two, three, and four-player modes<br></li><li>You choose who you play with \u2013 alongside Bernhard Ho\u00ebcker, on Team Elton, or perhaps you\u2019d prefer to play together with your friends?<br></li><li>Create your own character using a variety of different options<br></li><li>Check your game statistics regularly and compare them with your friends\u2019 \u2013 who has won the most money for their viewers?</li></ul><br><strong>Did you know that there are species of bamboo that grow up to three feet per day?</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f1dd7ac8f89c116c24b8132d6461d1a028cb7ff7.jpg","localized_name":"Einzelk\u00e4mpfer","name":"Einzelk\u00e4mpfer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782130/f1dd7ac8f89c116c24b8132d6461d1a028cb7ff7.jpg"},{"icon":"11f6d113aa1a05709c8bd428390fcc20949556e2.jpg","localized_name":"Doppelpack","name":"Doppelpack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782130/11f6d113aa1a05709c8bd428390fcc20949556e2.jpg"},{"icon":"5bdf7f4d4d2f65134210c1a6ef1343ee4bb42b